**proportionable, -nal, -nate.** All three adjectives have existed since the 14th c., & it is presumptuous to advise the superannuation of any of them.
>>>

<<<
 The statement may be ventured that the latest OED quotation for -nable is dated 1832, & that far from needing three words we can hardly provide two with separate functions;
===
